{"bookId": "3300070103", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1707823929, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_12_1282-1343", "createTime": 1707823929, "range": "1282-1343", "markText": "之所以我能在人的身上感受到一份悠然自得和轻松愉快，是因为我总能发现人类在移动和空间上所取得的经验，这也就是所谓的“生活”。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 12}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_11_10173-10286", "createTime": 1707808043, "range": "10173-10286", "markText": "语言首先是让人找到归属感的一个工具，其次才是获取知识或开启某个世界的途径。假如某人认为语言首先是建立理解的工具，那么，到了某个时期，他将会建造出一栋知识的大厦，但付出的代价却是成为知识的囚徒，关在知识的监狱里与周围的同事隔开。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_11_3998-4209", "createTime": 1707801226, "range": "3998-4209", "markText": "孩提时期，我心中的英雄是夏洛克·福尔摩斯。之所以钦佩他，是因为觉得他是一名超凡的地理学家，因为他从来不会迷失方向，不管身处伦敦或芝加哥的背街小巷，还是身陷犹他州或西藏的荒郊野外。同时，福尔摩斯在任何场合里都能泰然自若：无论是在公爵夫人的画室，还是在摩门教徒的厅堂，抑或身处一间鸦片馆，他都能表现得行为得体。这是我最钦佩的地方，因为就像大多数年轻人，我在面对社会的繁杂情况时也会手足无措，如同我面对地理学里的繁杂情况时一样。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_9_17092-17161", "createTime": 1707755378, "range": "17092-17161", "markText": "“移情”(empathy)对我来讲是很自然的一件事，而且我也在不断培养它，把它变成更具有社会性和产出性的能力——共情(sympathy)。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_8_10901-10972", "createTime": 1707556761, "range": "10901-10972", "markText": "其原因可能出于自尊心或者任性，但还有一件事——我不想伤害狗的感情，不想对它说：“我没有软玉温香可以揽入怀中，所以将就着摸摸你好了！”岂有此理！", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_7_4013-4129", "createTime": 1707543080, "range": "4013-4129", "markText": "他从来都没有真正把领事工作放在心上，因为他原本的愿望是能在一个文明的、多语言的环境下进行高等级的外交工作。他没法忘记，为了家庭，他不得不接受一次大幅度的降职。只有牺牲了自己的事业，他才得以把家人从衣食不足的中国带到了丰饶的澳大利亚。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_6_14198-14317", "createTime": 1707536242, "range": "14198-14317", "markText": "多年以后，1973年，我的弟弟段三孚在人民大会堂见到了周恩来。他们谈了四个小时的家庭事务——这是一个相当暖心的迹象，表明中国社会可以偶尔把个人需求放在国家日常事务之前。周恩来又提到邀请父亲去大陆，说父亲既然已退休了，就可以以个人名义来访。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_6_13141-13276", "createTime": 1707535981, "range": "13141-13276", "markText": "话题还得回到段祺瑞。《20世纪的中国》对他的评价并不高。很显然，他毕竟是一个军阀，只是比大多数军阀更成功而已。我愿意原谅他的错误，因为靠他的全程资助，我父亲才在南开中学完成学业。这一点很重要，因为我父亲在学校时最亲密的朋友是周恩来。除了友情之外，他们还是校刊的联合编辑。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6}, {"bookId": "3300070103", "bookmarkId": "3300070103_5_6343-6487", "createTime": 1707495871, "range": "6343-6487", "markText": "我开玩笑地对哥哥说，他之所以记得那么多而我却记得那么少，是因为他是个悲观主义者，而我是个乐观主义者。悲观主义者会认为自己的黄金时代在过去，相反，乐观主义者常把黄金时代放在未来。我可能是故意把自己的童年经历埋藏了起来，这样就不会停留在过去的诱惑里，就能更接受当下，并对未来抱有希望而非焦虑。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 5}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "2", "chapterUid": 12, "chapterIdx": 12}, {"title": "第五章 地理学拯救了我", "chapterUid": 11, "chapterIdx": 11}, {"title": "第四章 亲密：从正义到爱", "chapterUid": 9, "chapterIdx": 9}, {"title": "2", "chapterUid": 8, "chapterIdx": 8}, {"title": "第三章 我的个性：从父母到岩土", "chapterUid": 7, "chapterIdx": 7}, {"title": "第二章 世界舞台和公共事件", "chapterUid": 6, "chapterIdx": 6}, {"title": "第一章 自传：我的视角", "chapterUid": 5, "chapterIdx": 5}], "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "version": 754238487, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "K:K.L@M|-:~EayoeS[j@M{", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#002310"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#002607"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#002802"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#173724"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#003a1c"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#003c15"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#2b4f37"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#12522e"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#005526"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#005a14"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#2b6d42"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#00732e"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#42694d"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#008d44"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#5c8364"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#2e8a4f"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#749d7c"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#62a171"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#4da565"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#00ac4f"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#69c07d"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#50c471"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#27c765"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#a7d3ac"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#94d89f"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#4de37a"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#d0ead2"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#67ff8f"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#4da565"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#69c07d"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#E5F3E9"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#E5F3E9"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#002706"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#02984c", "hsv": [149.38403328395705, 98.59285928143711, 59.7260628742515]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/103/3300070103/s_3300070103.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/103/3300070103/s_3300070103.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#00ac4f", "#27c765"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7OXuooCq0", "review": {"bookVersion": 1520539360, "bookId": "3300070103", "content": "无法不爱如此诚恳，诚实自传，它可以为读者提供一面镜子，自我分析的镜子，也可以成为一个坐标用于衡量自我。", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7OXuooCq0", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707840528, "isDeepV": 1, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OXpzVlFU", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "信仰的力量，这与之前凡尔赛宫，金字塔，甚至长城都不一样。", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "5020-5202", "abstract": "然而，12世纪和13世纪的教堂标榜着“历史上第一批由自由劳工——联合起来的劳工——修建的大型建筑”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 12, "reviewId": "17408780_7OXpzVlFU", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707836117, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 12, "chapterTitle": "2", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OXaRZyse", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "人类为了满足自己的欲望，水都要去控制，一切都要有序，永远与墒增做斗争。", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "14012-14137", "abstract": "为了建造喷泉，需要从远处的运河、沟渠、渡槽引水，其中涉及复杂的管理和工程组织、熟练的匠人和大量的劳动力，他们相互之间要有效地配合起来。此外，还涉及水力学的知识以打造舞蹈艺术般的喷涌之势。从16世纪到18世纪，喷泉一直是欧洲王室用来炫耀的一个“宠物”。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "17408780_7OXaRZyse", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707822642, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "第五章 地理学拯救了我", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OWUBBMfN", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "现代艺术的起源来自于对个体意识的发掘。", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "9293-9373", "abstract": "到了20世纪晚期，个人的视角取代了大家共有的无所不包的视觉空间，每个人的视角都各不相同。因此，人们对视觉的理解和运用成为理解共同体到个体这一变化过程的一个表征。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11, "reviewId": "17408780_7OWUBBMfN", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707807742, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 11, "chapterTitle": "第五章 地理学拯救了我", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 4}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OWzIFRp5", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "就是风骚律师Saul所在的那个小城吧。", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "7768-7799", "abstract": "在阿尔伯克基，一件平淡无奇的小事让我发现了自己一直寻找的线索。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 10, "reviewId": "17408780_7OWzIFRp5", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707788608, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 10, "chapterTitle": "2", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OVZvrDjo", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "公情能力的高低是否与得罪他人的勇气相关？", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "17092-17161", "abstract": "“移情”(empathy)对我来讲是很自然的一件事，而且我也在不断培养它，把它变成更具有社会性和产出性的能力——共情(sympathy)。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7OVZvrDjo", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707755431, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "第四章 亲密：从正义到爱", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7OS9gbE8e", "review": {"bookId": "3300070103", "content": "那时候的知识分子很难不成为福尔摩斯的书迷吧。", "bookVersion": 1520539360, "range": "19899-20250", "abstract": "我的确有过几次成功——即获得了公众的认可。例如，每年8月我都会收到邀请，到芝加哥出席贝克街侦探小队(Baker Street Irregulars)美国分会的宴会。“福尔摩斯学”是一个研究领域，我很荣幸成为一个有价值的贡献者。这种荣誉仿佛是我的名字出现在了伦敦《星期日泰晤士报》(Sunday Times)体育版的头条。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_7OS9gbE8e", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1707537166, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300070103", "format": "epub", "version": 754238487, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/44/cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg/s_cpplatform_gu5kgahfxx9nll8ewb5ceg1693820386.jpg", "title": "我是谁？段义孚自传", "author": "段义孚", "translator": "志丞 刘苏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第二章 世界舞台和公共事件", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 7}}